description	"Anakin Skywalker

^2Weaponry:
- Anakin Skywalker's Lightsaber
-- Yellow/Red/Blue Styles
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump	(3)
- Push	(3)
- Sense	(3)
- Grip	(3)
- Dark Rage (3)
- Speed	(2)

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (3)
- Force Focus (1)

After hearing from Cliegg Lars about the Tusken abduction of his mother Anakin raced to the Tusken camp.

He found his mother who died shortly after seeing her son for the first time since he left to become a jedi."